Description: OpenPGP keys of the edulution.io package repository
 APT uses these keys to verify the package repository at
 package.edulution.io. The package installs them as
 /usr/share/keyrings/edulution.gpg, the keyring the repository's sources
 entry names in signed-by, so new or rotated keys reach every host with a
 regular upgrade.

